This worker uses the unmodified Encdr source at commit
a5414658a69c4330d10b95f2359371dfc8550326 from
https://github.com/RufusIbiza/Encdr as a pinned Cargo Git dependency.

Encdr is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later. Its upstream repository contains its
source, copyright notices, README and license. The verified upstream archive
for this revision has SHA-256
a536295722a69aa624cca9649cc1edeb6530d05a34cdcab65a4637ee7f7159b2.
The worker has its own Cargo.lock and does not replace the bridge's Encdr.
Offline builds require this Git revision in Cargo's cache.

The requested serial is a preference: unmodified upstream can select another
reported serial and does not expose the selected identity.
FRAME_OK means both upstream calls succeeded, not physical screen observation.
STOPPED means the request handles were dropped, not service ownership restored.
The parent supervisor must contain this process before ARM and bound all calls.
